Package: psyActive
Type: Package
Title: Auditable Workflows for Measurement-Based Mental Health Care
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Sisi", "Zheng", email = "zhengsisi@ccmu.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Provides data contracts, declarative instrument scoring, data
    quality assessment, personal baselines, reliable-change calculations,
    transparent longitudinal event detection, review workflows, and auditable
    reports for research and measurement-based mental health care. The package
    is designed as decision support: it does not diagnose conditions, recommend
    treatment, replace comprehensive suicide risk assessment, or initiate
    clinical action. Included instruments, reference values, and rules are
    synthetic demonstrations and must not be used as validated clinical tools.
